<title>USA: Medarex says starts colon cancer trial.</title>
<headline>Medarex says starts colon cancer trial.</headline>
<dateline>ANNANDALE, N.J. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medarex Inc said on Thursday it had started a Phase II clinical trial of its drug MDX-210 in colon cancer patients.</p>
<p>The trial will take place in Sweden and is designed to determine preliminary efficacy and give expanded evidence of the safety profile of MDX-210, the company said.</p>
<p>Phase I/II clinical trials of MDX-210 in patients with colon cancer and other tumors have taken place in the United States and Europe. Phase II clinical trials in prostate cancer patients started recently.  </p>
<p>Medarex is a biopharmaceutical company developing therapeutics targeted to enhance and direct the body's natural immune system to fight disease.</p>
</text>
